    "catalog:tags": "car, parking, vehicle",
    "catalog:note": "Medium car, front to +z, four wheels on the floor with a 2.70 wheelbase. A parking bay for it is 2.40 x 4.80 (Metric Handbook, unverified). The plan is the body outline with stepped bumper ends, the windscreen line and the rear-screen line; the screens are drawn upright, since a tilted part is unverified.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Medium car 1.80 x 4.50 x 1.45 (Neufert, unverified); bay 2.40 x 4.80 (Metric Handbook, unverified). No vehicle class in IFC4 ADD2 TC1 (buildingSMART Standards-builds), so IfcBuildingElementProxy USERDEFINED",
